Z||000000||mope||07-25-2001||10:27 AM||||It may be a dumb idea but i saw a ton of motercycles last year being escorted by state police. Do they get a permit for this?<P>Anyway, Is something like this possible to arrange across the US? If there would be a permit needed, someone that lives in each state could handle that. Say start on the east coast with only a few fieros going down I-80 (that runs coast to coast dont it?) As we pass thru each state we pick up a state police escort and continue on. I dunno i was just thinkin about it, i know just regular convoys have been made just for the hell of it, but why not one just for kicks, i know most people work and whatnot so that sucks, but let me know what you all think. I wouldnt know how to go about doing this, but i thought some of you might be bikers and know how they do it. <P>mope<P>------------------<BR>=======================<P>-= Silver 86 GT, being restored, All I need is a Black leather gt steering wheel! Please help me find one!<BR>My car looks perfect!<BR><A HREF="http://www.mastergraphics.cjb.net" TARGET=_blank>www.mastergraphics.cjb.net</A>  <A HREF="http://www.mope.cjb.net" TARGET=_blank>www.mope.cjb.net</A>||||reg||1
